    <node id="&quot;BLITZEN TRAPPER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Blitzen Trapper is an American alternative country band known for their experimental and evolving sound, including albums like 'VII' and 'American Goldwing'."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VII&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"VII is referenced as a disc number or album title."&lt;SEP&gt;"VII is referenced as a source, likely indicating a disc number or album title."&lt;SEP&gt;"VII is the seventh studio album by Blitzen Trapper, described as a futuristic hip-hop/country-rock hybrid and featuring the single 'Thirsty Man' which reached #29 on the Adult Alternative Songs Billboard chart."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0012-a556bfefd7ef</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN GOLDWING&quot;">
